<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Proofs</h2>

<div id="A1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Notations.</span> Consider a data set with <math id="A1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="|\mathcal{D}_{\text{VIT}}|" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi><mtext>VIT</mtext></msub><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">|\mathcal{D}_{\text{VIT}}|</annotation></semantics></math> samples where each sample consists of <math id="A1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N=n_{I}+n_{T}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>I</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>T</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N=n_{I}+n_{T}</annotation></semantics></math> number of tokens with embedding dimension D. We denote the dataset as <math id="A1.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{(X_{i},y_{i})}^{\mathcal{D}_{\text{VIT}}}_{i=1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi><mtext>VIT</mtext></msub></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{(X_{i},y_{i})}^{\mathcal{D}_{\text{VIT}}}_{i=1}</annotation></semantics></math>, where <math id="A1.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="X_{i}\in\mathbb{R}^{N\times d}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℝ</mi><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">X_{i}\in\mathbb{R}^{N\times d}</annotation></semantics></math>, and <math id="A1.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="y_{i}\in\mathbb{R}^{N}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℝ</mi><mi>N</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">y_{i}\in\mathbb{R}^{N}</annotation></semantics></math> is the label of the dataset. Following the settings in  <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite"><a href="#bib.bib31" title="" class="ltx_ref">Ormaniec et al. (2024)</a></cite>, we consider a single-layer attention Transformer model with a single head. Let <math id="A1.p1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="W_{Q},W_{K},W_{V}\in\mathbb{R}^{d\times D}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>Q</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>K</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>V</mi></msub><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℝ</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi>D</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">W_{Q},W_{K},W_{V}\in\mathbb{R}^{d\times D}</annotation></semantics></math> denote the weight matrices of Q, K, and V projection matrices, respectively.
The output from the Transformer model is formulated as:</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<table id="A1.EGx3" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.E9"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E9.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle A_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle A_{i}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E9.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{X_{i}W_{Q}W_{K}^{T}X^{T}_{i}}{\sqrt{D}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>Q</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>W</mi><mi>K</mi><mi>T</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>X</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>T</mi></msubsup></mrow><msqrt><mi>D</mi></msqrt></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\frac{X_{i}W_{Q}W_{K}^{T}X^{T}_{i}}{\sqrt{D}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(9)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.E10"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E10.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle S_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle S_{i}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E10.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\text{Softmax}(A_{i})=\text{Softmax}\bigg(\frac{X_{i}W_{Q}W_{K}^{T}X^{T}_{i}}{\sqrt{D}}\bigg)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mtext>Softmax</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mtext>Softmax</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="2.100em" minsize="2.100em">(</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>Q</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>W</mi><mi>K</mi><mi>T</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>X</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>T</mi></msubsup></mrow><msqrt><mi>D</mi></msqrt></mfrac></mstyle><mo maxsize="2.100em" minsize="2.100em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\text{Softmax}(A_{i})=\text{Softmax}\bigg(\frac{X_{i}W_{Q}W_{K}^{T}X^{T}_{i}}{\sqrt{D}}\bigg)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(10)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.E11"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E11.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle F_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle F_{i}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E11.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=S_{i}X_{i}W_{V}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>V</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=S_{i}X_{i}W_{V}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(11)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.p2.1" class="ltx_p">where <math id="A1.p2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="D" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>D</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">D</annotation></semantics></math> is the hidden dimension of the model.</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.p3" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.p3.1" class="ltx_p">We train the above Transformer using the Frobenius norm squared loss function.</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.p4" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<table id="A1.EGx4" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.E12"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E12.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathcal{L}_{i}=\frac{\|F_{i}-Y_{i}\|_{F}^{2}}{ND}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>Y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>D</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathcal{L}_{i}=\frac{\|F_{i}-Y_{i}\|_{F}^{2}}{ND}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(12)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A1.p5" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.p5.1" class="ltx_p">Note that, for brevity, we use <math id="A1.p5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S_{i}</annotation></semantics></math> instead of <math id="A1.p5.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="A_{i}^{l}(\phi)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>A</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>l</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>ϕ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">A_{i}^{l}(\phi)</annotation></semantics></math> in Equation <a href="#S4.E4" title="In 4.1 Finding Clusters of Examples with Similar Gradient ‣ 4 Method: Extracting Non-redundant Subsets of the VIT Data ‣ Data Selection for Fine-tuning Vision Language Models via Cross Modal Alignment Trajectories" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4</span></a> to denote the attention matrix. In addition, we write the cross-modal attention matrix <math id="A1.p5.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\chi_{i}(\phi)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>χ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>ϕ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\chi_{i}(\phi)</annotation></semantics></math> as <math id="A1.p5.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\chi_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>χ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\chi_{i}</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.p6" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.p6.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p6.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Assumptions.</span> We assume that the model embedding <math id="A1.p6.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="X_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">X_{i}</annotation></semantics></math> and weight matrices <math id="A1.p6.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="W_{\{Q,K,V\}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>W</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>K</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>V</mi><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">W_{\{Q,K,V\}}</annotation></semantics></math> have bounded norms. Let <math id="A1.p6.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="X,Q,K" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">X,Q,K</annotation></semantics></math>, and <math id="A1.p6.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="V" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>V</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">V</annotation></semantics></math> be their corresponding upper bounds. In addition, the attention matrix <math id="A1.p6.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S_{i}</annotation></semantics></math> also has a bounded norm <math id="A1.p6.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>S</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S</annotation></semantics></math> as each entity is bounded between 0 and 1. Furthermore, we assume that the model always makes a reasonable prediction which is not far from the ground-truth label. In other words, the loss is bounded and we denote the upper bound of the norm of the difference between the predicted output and ground-truth label as <math id="A1.p6.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\alpha=\sup_{i}\|F_{i}-y_{i}\|" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo rspace="0.1389em">=</mo><mrow><msub><mo lspace="0.1389em" rspace="0em">sup</mo><mi>i</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha=\sup_{i}\|F_{i}-y_{i}\|</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.p7" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.p7.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p7.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Bound of target alignment trajectories.</span> From the assumption that the alignment trajectories of proxy and target models are close, we have:</p>
<table id="A1.E13" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.E13.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\|\chi^{\text{proxy}}_{i}-\chi^{\text{target}}_{i}\|\leq T,\quad\forall i." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>χ</mi><mi>i</mi><mtext>proxy</mtext></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>χ</mi><mi>i</mi><mtext>target</mtext></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><mo rspace="1.167em">,</mo><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">∀</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\|\chi^{\text{proxy}}_{i}-\chi^{\text{target}}_{i}\|\leq T,\quad\forall i.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(13)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A1.p8" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.p8.1" class="ltx_p">For <math id="A1.p8.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>i</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A1.p8.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="j" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>j</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">j</annotation></semantics></math> in the same cluster <math id="A1.p8.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="C_{k}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">C_{k}</annotation></semantics></math> based on the proxy model, we have:</p>
<table id="A1.E14" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.E14.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\|\chi^{\text{proxy}}_{i}-\chi^{\text{proxy}}_{j}\|\leq K_{ij}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>χ</mi><mi>i</mi><mtext>proxy</mtext></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>χ</mi><mi>j</mi><mtext>proxy</mtext></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>K</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\|\chi^{\text{proxy}}_{i}-\chi^{\text{proxy}}_{j}\|\leq K_{ij}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(14)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A1.p9" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.p9.1" class="ltx_p">Using the triangle inequality:</p>
<table id="A1.E15" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_table">
<tbody>
<tr id="A1.E15X" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E15X.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\|\chi^{\text{target}}_{i}-\chi^{\text{target}}_{j}\|" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>χ</mi><mi>i</mi><mtext>target</mtext></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>χ</mi><mi>j</mi><mtext>target</mtext></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\|\chi^{\text{target}}_{i}-\chi^{\text{target}}_{j}\|</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E15X.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq\|\chi^{\text{target}}_{i}-\chi^{\text{proxy}}_{i}\|+\|\chi^{\text{proxy}}_{i}-\chi^{\text{proxy}}_{j}\|+\|\chi^{\text{proxy}}_{j}-\chi^{\text{target}}_{j}\|" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>χ</mi><mi>i</mi><mtext>target</mtext></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>χ</mi><mi>i</mi><mtext>proxy</mtext></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>χ</mi><mi>i</mi><mtext>proxy</mtext></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>χ</mi><mi>j</mi><mtext>proxy</mtext></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>χ</mi><mi>j</mi><mtext>proxy</mtext></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>χ</mi><mi>j</mi><mtext>target</mtext></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq\|\chi^{\text{target}}_{i}-\chi^{\text{proxy}}_{i}\|+\|\chi^{\text{proxy}}_{i}-\chi^{\text{proxy}}_{j}\|+\|\chi^{\text{proxy}}_{j}-\chi^{\text{target}}_{j}\|</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="2" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equationgroup ltx_align_right">(15)</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.E15Xa" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E15Xa.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq 2T+K_{ij}=\epsilon^{\prime}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>K</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>ϵ</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq 2T+K_{ij}=\epsilon^{\prime}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A1.p10" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.p10.1" class="ltx_p">Therefore, for two samples <math id="A1.p10.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>i</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A1.p10.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="j" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>j</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">j</annotation></semantics></math> in the same cluster <math id="A1.p10.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="C_{k}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">C_{k}</annotation></semantics></math> at any iteration <math id="A1.p10.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>t</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t</annotation></semantics></math>, we have:</p>
<table id="A1.E16" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.E16.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\|\chi^{\text{target}}_{i}-\chi^{\text{target}}_{j}\|\leq\epsilon^{\prime},\quad\forall t." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>χ</mi><mi>i</mi><mtext>target</mtext></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>χ</mi><mi>j</mi><mtext>target</mtext></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mo>≤</mo><msup><mi>ϵ</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></mrow><mo rspace="1.167em">,</mo><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">∀</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\|\chi^{\text{target}}_{i}-\chi^{\text{target}}_{j}\|\leq\epsilon^{\prime},\quad\forall t.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(16)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A1.p11" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.p11.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p11.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Gradient decomposition.</span> Before bounding the gradient difference of the target model, we introduce the expressions of the model gradient w.r.t different weight matrices in the following lemma.</p>
</div>
<div id="Thmlemma1" class="ltx_theorem ltx_theorem_lemma">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_title_theorem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_theorem"><span id="Thmlemma1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Lemma 1</span></span><span id="Thmlemma1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">.</span></h6>
<div id="Thmlemma1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="Thmlemma1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Thmlemma1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Jacobians of the attention weight matrices <math id="Thmlemma1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="W_{\{Q,K,V\}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>W</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>K</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>V</mi><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">W_{\{Q,K,V\}}</annotation></semantics></math> have the following form:</span></p>
</div>
<div id="Thmlemma1.p2" class="ltx_para">
<ol id="A1.I1" class="ltx_enumerate">
<li id="A1.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">1.</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><math id="A1.I1.i1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\nabla_{W_{V}}\mathcal{L}_{i}(\phi^{t})=\frac{2}{ND}(F_{i}-y_{i})(S_{i}X_{i}\otimes I_{D})=\frac{2}{ND}(S_{i}X_{i}W_{V}-y_{i})(S_{i}X_{i}\otimes I_{D})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mo>∇</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>V</mi></msub></msub><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>ϕ</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>D</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⊗</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>D</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>D</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>V</mi></msub></mrow><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⊗</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>D</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\nabla_{W_{V}}\mathcal{L}_{i}(\phi^{t})=\frac{2}{ND}(F_{i}-y_{i})(S_{i}X_{i}\otimes I_{D})=\frac{2}{ND}(S_{i}X_{i}W_{V}-y_{i})(S_{i}X_{i}\otimes I_{D})</annotation></semantics></math></p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">2.</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.I1.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><math id="A1.I1.i2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\nabla_{W_{Q}}\mathcal{L}_{i}(\phi^{t})=\frac{2}{ND}(S_{i}X_{i}W_{V}-y_{i})(I_{N}\otimes W_{V}^{T}X_{i}^{T})\frac{\partial S_{i}}{\partial A_{i}}\frac{X_{i}\otimes X_{i}W_{K}}{\sqrt{D}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mo>∇</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>Q</mi></msub></msub><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>ϕ</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>D</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>V</mi></msub></mrow><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>N</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⊗</mo><msubsup><mi>W</mi><mi>V</mi><mi>T</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>X</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>T</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>∂</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mo>∂</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mfrac><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⊗</mo><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>K</mi></msub></mrow><msqrt><mi>D</mi></msqrt></mfrac></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\nabla_{W_{Q}}\mathcal{L}_{i}(\phi^{t})=\frac{2}{ND}(S_{i}X_{i}W_{V}-y_{i})(I_{N}\otimes W_{V}^{T}X_{i}^{T})\frac{\partial S_{i}}{\partial A_{i}}\frac{X_{i}\otimes X_{i}W_{K}}{\sqrt{D}}</annotation></semantics></math></p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">3.</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I1.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><math id="A1.I1.i3.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\nabla_{W_{K}}\mathcal{N}_{i}(\phi^{t})=\frac{2}{ND}(S_{i}X_{i}W_{V}-y_{i})(I_{N}\otimes W_{V}^{T}X_{i}^{T})\frac{\partial S_{i}}{\partial A_{i}}(\frac{X_{i}\otimes X_{i}W_{Q}}{\sqrt{D}})\Lambda_{D,d}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mo>∇</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>K</mi></msub></msub><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>ϕ</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>D</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>V</mi></msub></mrow><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>N</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⊗</mo><msubsup><mi>W</mi><mi>V</mi><mi>T</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>X</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>T</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>∂</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mo>∂</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mfrac><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⊗</mo><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>Q</mi></msub></mrow><msqrt><mi>D</mi></msqrt></mfrac><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Λ</mi><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\nabla_{W_{K}}\mathcal{N}_{i}(\phi^{t})=\frac{2}{ND}(S_{i}X_{i}W_{V}-y_{i})(I_{N}\otimes W_{V}^{T}X_{i}^{T})\frac{\partial S_{i}}{\partial A_{i}}(\frac{X_{i}\otimes X_{i}W_{Q}}{\sqrt{D}})\Lambda_{D,d}</annotation></semantics></math></p>
</div></li>
</ol>
</div>
</div>
<div id="A1.p12" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.p12.1" class="ltx_p">where <math id="A1.p12.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="I_{L}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>L</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">I_{L}</annotation></semantics></math> denotes the identity matrix of size <math id="A1.p12.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="L" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>L</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">L</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A1.p12.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Lambda_{D,d}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Λ</mi><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Lambda_{D,d}</annotation></semantics></math> is the commutation matrix.</p>
</div>
<div id="Thmlemma2" class="ltx_theorem ltx_theorem_lemma">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_title_theorem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_theorem"><span id="Thmlemma2.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Lemma 2</span></span><span id="Thmlemma2.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">.</span></h6>
<div id="Thmlemma2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="Thmlemma2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Thmlemma2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Bound on the Frobenius norm of the Jacobian of the attention matrix:</span></p>
<table id="A1.E17" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.E17.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\|\nabla_{A_{i}}S_{i}\|_{F}\leq\frac{\sqrt{N}}{2}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msub><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></msub><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub><mo>≤</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mi>N</mi></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\|\nabla_{A_{i}}S_{i}\|_{F}\leq\frac{\sqrt{N}}{2}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(17)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
</div>
<section id="A1.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.1 </span>Proof of Theorem <a href="#S4.Thmtheorem1" title="Theorem 4.1. ‣ 4.1.1 Bounding Gradient Distance via Attention Distance ‣ 4.1 Finding Clusters of Examples with Similar Gradient ‣ 4 Method: Extracting Non-redundant Subsets of the VIT Data ‣ Data Selection for Fine-tuning Vision Language Models via Cross Modal Alignment Trajectories" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4.1</span></a></h3>

<div id="A1.SS1.2" class="ltx_proof">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_font_italic ltx_title_proof">Proof.</h6>
<div id="A1.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text">Since we have considered a simplified model with only three parameters, <math id="A1.SS1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="W_{Q}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>Q</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">W_{Q}</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="A1.SS1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="W_{K}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>K</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">W_{K}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A1.SS1.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="W_{V}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>V</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">W_{V}</annotation></semantics></math>, our goal now is to find <math id="A1.SS1.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\|\nabla\mathcal{L}_{i}(\phi_{target}^{t})-\nabla\mathcal{L}_{j}(\phi_{target}^{t})\|_{F}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>ϕ</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mi>t</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>ϕ</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mi>t</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\|\nabla\mathcal{L}_{i}(\phi_{target}^{t})-\nabla\mathcal{L}_{j}(\phi_{target}^{t})\|_{F}</annotation></semantics></math>
which can be expanded as</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx5" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.E18"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E18.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\|\nabla\mathcal{L}_{i}(\phi_{\text{target}}^{t})-\nabla\mathcal{L}_{j}(\phi_{\text{target}}^{t})\|_{F}=\sqrt{\begin{aligned} &amp;\|\nabla_{W_{V}}\mathcal{L}_{i}(\phi_{\text{target}}^{t})-\nabla_{W_{V}}\mathcal{L}_{j}(\phi_{\text{target}}^{t})\|_{F}^{2}\\
&amp;+\|\nabla_{W_{Q}}\mathcal{L}_{i}(\phi_{\text{target}}^{t})-\nabla_{W_{Q}}\mathcal{L}_{j}(\phi_{\text{target}}^{t})\|_{F}^{2}\\
&amp;+\|\nabla_{W_{K}}\mathcal{L}_{i}(\phi_{\text{target}}^{t})-\nabla_{W_{K}}\mathcal{L}_{j}(\phi_{\text{target}}^{t})\|_{F}^{2}\end{aligned}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>ϕ</mi><mtext>target</mtext><mi>t</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>ϕ</mi><mtext>target</mtext><mi>t</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mtable columnspacing="0pt" rowspacing="0pt"><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>V</mi></msub></msub><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>ϕ</mi><mtext>target</mtext><mi>t</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>V</mi></msub></msub><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>ϕ</mi><mtext>target</mtext><mi>t</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>Q</mi></msub></msub><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>ϕ</mi><mtext>target</mtext><mi>t</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>Q</mi></msub></msub><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>ϕ</mi><mtext>target</mtext><mi>t</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>K</mi></msub></msub><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>ϕ</mi><mtext>target</mtext><mi>t</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>K</mi></msub></msub><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>ϕ</mi><mtext>target</mtext><mi>t</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></mtd></mtr></mtable></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\|\nabla\mathcal{L}_{i}(\phi_{\text{target}}^{t})-\nabla\mathcal{L}_{j}(\phi_{\text{target}}^{t})\|_{F}=\sqrt{\begin{aligned} &amp;\|\nabla_{W_{V}}\mathcal{L}_{i}(\phi_{\text{target}}^{t})-\nabla_{W_{V}}\mathcal{L}_{j}(\phi_{\text{target}}^{t})\|_{F}^{2}\\
&amp;+\|\nabla_{W_{Q}}\mathcal{L}_{i}(\phi_{\text{target}}^{t})-\nabla_{W_{Q}}\mathcal{L}_{j}(\phi_{\text{target}}^{t})\|_{F}^{2}\\
&amp;+\|\nabla_{W_{K}}\mathcal{L}_{i}(\phi_{\text{target}}^{t})-\nabla_{W_{K}}\mathcal{L}_{j}(\phi_{\text{target}}^{t})\|_{F}^{2}\end{aligned}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(18)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS1.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS1.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS1.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text">To bound the LHS in Equation <a href="#A1.E18" title="In Proof. ‣ A.1 Proof of Theorem ‣ Appendix A Proofs ‣ Data Selection for Fine-tuning Vision Language Models via Cross Modal Alignment Trajectories" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">18</span></a>, we first bound each term in the RHS.</span></p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS1.p3" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS1.p3.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS1.p3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Bound for <math id="A1.SS1.p3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="W_{V}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>V</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">W_{V}</annotation></semantics></math>.<span id="A1.SS1.p3.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> We simplify the first term in Equation <a href="#A1.E18" title="In Proof. ‣ A.1 Proof of Theorem ‣ Appendix A Proofs ‣ Data Selection for Fine-tuning Vision Language Models via Cross Modal Alignment Trajectories" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">18</span></a> as follows:</span></span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx6" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex2"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\|\nabla_{W_{V}}\mathcal{L}_{i}(\phi_{\text{target}}^{t})-\nabla_{W_{V}}\mathcal{L}_{j}(\phi_{\text{target}}^{t})\|_{F}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>V</mi></msub></msub><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>ϕ</mi><mtext>target</mtext><mi>t</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>V</mi></msub></msub><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>ϕ</mi><mtext>target</mtext><mi>t</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\|\nabla_{W_{V}}\mathcal{L}_{i}(\phi_{\text{target}}^{t})-\nabla_{W_{V}}\mathcal{L}_{j}(\phi_{\text{target}}^{t})\|_{F}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex3"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\stackrel{{\scriptstyle(i)}}{{=}}\frac{2}{ND}\|(S_{i}X_{i}W_{V}-y_{i})(S_{i}X_{i}\otimes I_{D})-(S_{j}X_{j}W_{V}-y_{j})(S_{j}X_{j}\otimes I_{D})\|_{F}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mover><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mover><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>D</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>V</mi></msub></mrow><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⊗</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>D</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>V</mi></msub></mrow><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⊗</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>D</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\stackrel{{\scriptstyle(i)}}{{=}}\frac{2}{ND}\|(S_{i}X_{i}W_{V}-y_{i})(S_{i}X_{i}\otimes I_{D})-(S_{j}X_{j}W_{V}-y_{j})(S_{j}X_{j}\otimes I_{D})\|_{F}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex4"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{2}{ND}\|S_{i}X_{i}W_{V}((S_{i}X_{i}-S_{j}X_{j})\otimes I_{D})+(S_{i}X_{i}-S_{j}X_{j})W_{V}(S_{j}X_{j}\otimes I_{D})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>D</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo fence="false">|</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>V</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">⊗</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>D</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>V</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⊗</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>D</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\frac{2}{ND}\|S_{i}X_{i}W_{V}((S_{i}X_{i}-S_{j}X_{j})\otimes I_{D})+(S_{i}X_{i}-S_{j}X_{j})W_{V}(S_{j}X_{j}\otimes I_{D})</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex5"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex5.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\quad+y_{j}((S_{j}X_{j}-S_{i}X_{i})\otimes I_{D})+(y_{j}-y_{i})(S_{i}X_{i}\otimes I_{D})\|_{F}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">⊗</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>D</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⊗</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>D</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><msub><mo lspace="0em">∥</mo><mi>F</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\quad+y_{j}((S_{j}X_{j}-S_{i}X_{i})\otimes I_{D})+(y_{j}-y_{i})(S_{i}X_{i}\otimes I_{D})\|_{F}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex6"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex6.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\stackrel{{\scriptstyle(ii)}}{{\leq}}\frac{2}{ND}\|S_{i}X_{i}W_{V}((S_{i}X_{i}-S_{j}X_{j})\otimes I_{D})\|_{F}+\frac{2}{ND}\|(S_{i}X_{i}-S_{j}X_{j})W_{V}(S_{j}X_{j}\otimes I_{D})\|_{F}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mover><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mover><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>D</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>V</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">⊗</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>D</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>D</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>V</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⊗</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>D</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\stackrel{{\scriptstyle(ii)}}{{\leq}}\frac{2}{ND}\|S_{i}X_{i}W_{V}((S_{i}X_{i}-S_{j}X_{j})\otimes I_{D})\|_{F}+\frac{2}{ND}\|(S_{i}X_{i}-S_{j}X_{j})W_{V}(S_{j}X_{j}\otimes I_{D})\|_{F}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex7"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex7.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\quad+\frac{2}{ND}\|y_{j}((S_{j}X_{j}-S_{i}X_{i})\otimes I_{D})\|_{F}+\frac{2}{ND}\|(y_{j}-y_{i})(S_{i}X_{i}\otimes I_{D})\|_{F}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>D</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">⊗</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>D</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>D</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⊗</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>D</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\quad+\frac{2}{ND}\|y_{j}((S_{j}X_{j}-S_{i}X_{i})\otimes I_{D})\|_{F}+\frac{2}{ND}\|(y_{j}-y_{i})(S_{i}X_{i}\otimes I_{D})\|_{F}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex8"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex8.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\stackrel{{\scriptstyle(iii)}}{{\leq}}\frac{2SXV}{N}\|(S_{i}(X_{i}-X_{j})+(S_{i}-S_{j})X_{j}\|_{F}+\frac{2SXV}{N}\|(S_{i}(X_{i}-X_{j})+(S_{i}-S_{j})X_{j}\|_{F}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mover><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mover><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>S</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>X</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>V</mi></mrow><mi>N</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∥</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∥</mo><mi>F</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em">+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>S</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>X</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>V</mi></mrow><mi>N</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∥</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><msub><mo lspace="0em">∥</mo><mi>F</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\stackrel{{\scriptstyle(iii)}}{{\leq}}\frac{2SXV}{N}\|(S_{i}(X_{i}-X_{j})+(S_{i}-S_{j})X_{j}\|_{F}+\frac{2SXV}{N}\|(S_{i}(X_{i}-X_{j})+(S_{i}-S_{j})X_{j}\|_{F}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex9"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex9.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\quad+\frac{2}{N}B\|(S_{i}(X_{i}-X_{j})+(S_{i}-S_{j})X_{j}\|_{F}+\frac{4BSX}{N}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mi>N</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mi>B</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∥</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∥</mo><mi>F</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em">+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>B</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>S</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>X</mi></mrow><mi>N</mi></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\quad+\frac{2}{N}B\|(S_{i}(X_{i}-X_{j})+(S_{i}-S_{j})X_{j}\|_{F}+\frac{4BSX}{N}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex10"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex10.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\stackrel{{\scriptstyle(iv)}}{{\leq}}\frac{8S^{2}X^{2}V}{N}+\frac{4SX^{2}V}{N}\|S_{i}-S_{j}\|_{F}+\frac{4BSX}{N}+\frac{2BX}{N}\|S_{i}-S_{j}\|_{F}+\frac{4BSX}{N}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mover><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>v</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mover><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>S</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>X</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>V</mi></mrow><mi>N</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>S</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>X</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>V</mi></mrow><mi>N</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>B</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>S</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>X</mi></mrow><mi>N</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>B</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>X</mi></mrow><mi>N</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>B</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>S</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>X</mi></mrow><mi>N</mi></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\stackrel{{\scriptstyle(iv)}}{{\leq}}\frac{8S^{2}X^{2}V}{N}+\frac{4SX^{2}V}{N}\|S_{i}-S_{j}\|_{F}+\frac{4BSX}{N}+\frac{2BX}{N}\|S_{i}-S_{j}\|_{F}+\frac{4BSX}{N}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex11"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex11.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\stackrel{{\scriptstyle(v)}}{{\leq}}\bigg(\frac{4SX^{2}V}{N}+\frac{2BX}{N}\bigg)\|S_{i}-S_{j}\|_{F}+\frac{8SX}{N}(B+SXV)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mover><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mover><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo maxsize="2.100em" minsize="2.100em">(</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>S</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>X</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>V</mi></mrow><mi>N</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>B</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>X</mi></mrow><mi>N</mi></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo maxsize="2.100em" minsize="2.100em">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>S</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>X</mi></mrow><mi>N</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>X</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>V</mi></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\stackrel{{\scriptstyle(v)}}{{\leq}}\bigg(\frac{4SX^{2}V}{N}+\frac{2BX}{N}\bigg)\|S_{i}-S_{j}\|_{F}+\frac{8SX}{N}(B+SXV)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(19)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS1.p4" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS1.p4.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS1.p4.1.1" class="ltx_text">where (i) comes from Lemma 1; (ii) uses triangle inequality; (iii) applies assumed bounds; (iv) uses <math id="A1.SS1.p4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\|X_{i}-X_{j}\|_{F}\leq 2X" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>X</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\|X_{i}-X_{j}\|_{F}\leq 2X</annotation></semantics></math>; (v) rearranging.</span></p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS1.p5" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS1.p5.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS1.p5.1.1" class="ltx_text">Now, consider the following relation for the attention matrix:</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx7" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.E20"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E20.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle S_{i}=\chi_{i}+\chi^{T}_{i}+S^{r}_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>χ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>χ</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>T</mi></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>S</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>r</mi></msubsup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle S_{i}=\chi_{i}+\chi^{T}_{i}+S^{r}_{i}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(20)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS1.p6" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS1.p6.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS1.p6.1.1" class="ltx_text">where <math id="A1.SS1.p6.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\chi_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>χ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\chi_{i}</annotation></semantics></math> is the cross-modal attention part (bottom-left section) of the attention matrix that is considered in the actual experiments. <math id="A1.SS1.p6.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\chi_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>χ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\chi_{i}</annotation></semantics></math> is the same shape as <math id="A1.SS1.p6.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\chi_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>χ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\chi_{i}</annotation></semantics></math> with rest of the entries being zero. Similary, <math id="A1.SS1.p6.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S^{r}_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi>S</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>r</mi></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S^{r}_{i}</annotation></semantics></math> is the same shape as <math id="A1.SS1.p6.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S_{i}</annotation></semantics></math>, with entries in the cross-modal attention part being zero and all other entries being non-zero. Now, consider the following difference:</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx8" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex12"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex12.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\|\nabla_{W_{V}}\mathcal{N}_{i}(\phi_{\text{target}}^{t})-\nabla_{W_{V}}\mathcal{N}_{j}(\phi_{\text{target}}^{t})\|_{F}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>V</mi></msub></msub><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>ϕ</mi><mtext>target</mtext><mi>t</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>V</mi></msub></msub><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>ϕ</mi><mtext>target</mtext><mi>t</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\|\nabla_{W_{V}}\mathcal{N}_{i}(\phi_{\text{target}}^{t})-\nabla_{W_{V}}\mathcal{N}_{j}(\phi_{\text{target}}^{t})\|_{F}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex13"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex13.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\stackrel{{\scriptstyle(i)}}{{\leq}}\bigg(\frac{4SX^{2}V}{N}+\frac{2BX}{N}\bigg)\|\chi_{i}-\chi_{j}+\chi^{T}_{i}-\chi^{T}_{j}+S^{r}_{i}-S^{r}_{j}\|_{F}+\frac{8SX}{N}(B+SXV)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mover><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mover><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo maxsize="2.100em" minsize="2.100em">(</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>S</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>X</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>V</mi></mrow><mi>N</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>B</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>X</mi></mrow><mi>N</mi></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo maxsize="2.100em" minsize="2.100em">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>χ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>χ</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>χ</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>T</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>χ</mi><mi>j</mi><mi>T</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>S</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>r</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>S</mi><mi>j</mi><mi>r</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>S</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>X</mi></mrow><mi>N</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>X</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>V</mi></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\stackrel{{\scriptstyle(i)}}{{\leq}}\bigg(\frac{4SX^{2}V}{N}+\frac{2BX}{N}\bigg)\|\chi_{i}-\chi_{j}+\chi^{T}_{i}-\chi^{T}_{j}+S^{r}_{i}-S^{r}_{j}\|_{F}+\frac{8SX}{N}(B+SXV)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex14"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex14.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\stackrel{{\scriptstyle(ii)}}{{\leq}}\bigg(\frac{8SX^{2}V}{N}+\frac{4BX}{N}\bigg)\|\chi_{i}-\chi_{j}\|_{F}+\bigg(\frac{4SX^{2}V}{N}+\frac{2BX}{N}\bigg)\|S^{r}_{i}-S^{r}_{j}\|_{F}+\frac{8SX}{N}(B+SXV)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mover><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mover><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo maxsize="2.100em" minsize="2.100em">(</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>S</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>X</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>V</mi></mrow><mi>N</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>B</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>X</mi></mrow><mi>N</mi></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo maxsize="2.100em" minsize="2.100em">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msub><mi>χ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>χ</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mo maxsize="2.100em" minsize="2.100em">(</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>S</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>X</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>V</mi></mrow><mi>N</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>B</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>X</mi></mrow><mi>N</mi></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo maxsize="2.100em" minsize="2.100em">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>S</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>r</mi></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>S</mi><mi>j</mi><mi>r</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>S</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>X</mi></mrow><mi>N</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>X</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>V</mi></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\stackrel{{\scriptstyle(ii)}}{{\leq}}\bigg(\frac{8SX^{2}V}{N}+\frac{4BX}{N}\bigg)\|\chi_{i}-\chi_{j}\|_{F}+\bigg(\frac{4SX^{2}V}{N}+\frac{2BX}{N}\bigg)\|S^{r}_{i}-S^{r}_{j}\|_{F}+\frac{8SX}{N}(B+SXV)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex15"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex15.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\stackrel{{\scriptstyle(iii)}}{{\leq}}\bigg(\frac{8SX^{2}V}{N}+\frac{4BX}{N}\bigg)\|\chi_{i}-\chi_{j}\|_{F}+\frac{4SX}{L}(4SXV+3B)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mover><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mover><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo maxsize="2.100em" minsize="2.100em">(</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>S</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>X</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>V</mi></mrow><mi>N</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>B</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>X</mi></mrow><mi>N</mi></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo maxsize="2.100em" minsize="2.100em">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msub><mi>χ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>χ</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>S</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>X</mi></mrow><mi>L</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>S</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>X</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>V</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\stackrel{{\scriptstyle(iii)}}{{\leq}}\bigg(\frac{8SX^{2}V}{N}+\frac{4BX}{N}\bigg)\|\chi_{i}-\chi_{j}\|_{F}+\frac{4SX}{L}(4SXV+3B)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex16"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex16.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\bigg(\frac{8SX^{2}V}{N}+\frac{4BX}{N}\bigg)\epsilon^{\prime}+\frac{4SX}{N}(4SXV+3B)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo maxsize="2.100em" minsize="2.100em">(</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>S</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>X</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>V</mi></mrow><mi>N</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>B</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>X</mi></mrow><mi>N</mi></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo maxsize="2.100em" minsize="2.100em">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>ϵ</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>S</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>X</mi></mrow><mi>N</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>S</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>X</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>V</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\bigg(\frac{8SX^{2}V}{N}+\frac{4BX}{N}\bigg)\epsilon^{\prime}+\frac{4SX}{N}(4SXV+3B)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(21)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS1.p7" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS1.p7.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS1.p7.1.1" class="ltx_text">where (i) from equation <a href="#A1.E20" title="In Proof. ‣ A.1 Proof of Theorem ‣ Appendix A Proofs ‣ Data Selection for Fine-tuning Vision Language Models via Cross Modal Alignment Trajectories" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">20</span></a>; (ii) applies triangle inequality; (iii) <math id="A1.SS1.p7.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\|S^{r}_{i}-S^{r}_{j}\|_{F}\leq 2S" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>S</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>r</mi></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>S</mi><mi>j</mi><mi>r</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\|S^{r}_{i}-S^{r}_{j}\|_{F}\leq 2S</annotation></semantics></math>.</span></p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS1.p8" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS1.p8.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS1.p8.1.1" class="ltx_text">Let <math id="A1.SS1.p8.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="f_{1}(\epsilon^{\prime})=\bigg(\frac{8SX^{2}V}{N}+\frac{4BX}{N}\bigg)\epsilon^{\prime}+\frac{4SX}{N}(4SXV+3B)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>ϵ</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo maxsize="2.100em" minsize="2.100em">(</mo><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>S</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>X</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>V</mi></mrow><mi>N</mi></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>B</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>X</mi></mrow><mi>N</mi></mfrac></mrow><mo maxsize="2.100em" minsize="2.100em">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>ϵ</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>S</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>X</mi></mrow><mi>N</mi></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>S</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>X</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>V</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">f_{1}(\epsilon^{\prime})=\bigg(\frac{8SX^{2}V}{N}+\frac{4BX}{N}\bigg)\epsilon^{\prime}+\frac{4SX}{N}(4SXV+3B)</annotation></semantics></math> be an affine function of <math id="A1.SS1.p8.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\epsilon^{\prime}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>ϵ</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\epsilon^{\prime}</annotation></semantics></math>, we can bound the gradient difference w.r.t <math id="A1.SS1.p8.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="W_{V}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>V</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">W_{V}</annotation></semantics></math> as</span></p>
<table id="A1.E22" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.E22.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\|\nabla_{W_{V}}\mathcal{L}_{i}(\phi_{\text{target}}^{t})-\nabla_{W_{V}}\mathcal{L}_{j}(\phi_{\text{target}}^{t})\|_{F}\leq f_{1}(\epsilon^{\prime})" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>V</mi></msub></msub><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>ϕ</mi><mtext>target</mtext><mi>t</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>V</mi></msub></msub><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>ϕ</mi><mtext>target</mtext><mi>t</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub><mo>≤</mo><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>ϵ</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\|\nabla_{W_{V}}\mathcal{L}_{i}(\phi_{\text{target}}^{t})-\nabla_{W_{V}}\mathcal{L}_{j}(\phi_{\text{target}}^{t})\|_{F}\leq f_{1}(\epsilon^{\prime})</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(22)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS1.p9" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS1.p9.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS1.p9.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Bound for <math id="A1.SS1.p9.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="W_{Q}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>Q</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">W_{Q}</annotation></semantics></math>.<span id="A1.SS1.p9.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> We simplify the second term in Equation <a href="#A1.E18" title="In Proof. ‣ A.1 Proof of Theorem ‣ Appendix A Proofs ‣ Data Selection for Fine-tuning Vision Language Models via Cross Modal Alignment Trajectories" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">18</span></a> as follows:</span></span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx9" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex17"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex17.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\|\nabla_{W_{Q}}\mathcal{L}_{i}(\phi_{\text{target}}^{t})-\nabla_{W_{Q}}\mathcal{L}_{j}(\phi_{\text{target}}^{t})\|_{F}^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>Q</mi></msub></msub><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>ϕ</mi><mtext>target</mtext><mi>t</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>Q</mi></msub></msub><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>ϕ</mi><mtext>target</mtext><mi>t</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\|\nabla_{W_{Q}}\mathcal{L}_{i}(\phi_{\text{target}}^{t})-\nabla_{W_{Q}}\mathcal{L}_{j}(\phi_{\text{target}}^{t})\|_{F}^{2}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex18"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex18.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\stackrel{{\scriptstyle(i)}}{{=}}\frac{2}{ND}\bigg\|(S_{i}X_{i}W_{V}-y_{i})(I_{N}\otimes W_{V}^{T}X_{i}^{T})\frac{\partial S_{i}}{\partial A_{i}}\frac{X_{i}\otimes X_{i}W_{K}}{\sqrt{D}}-(S_{j}X_{j}W_{V}-y_{j})(I_{N}\otimes W_{V}^{T}X_{j}^{T})\frac{\partial S_{j}}{\partial A_{j}}\frac{X_{j}\otimes X_{j}W_{K}}{\sqrt{D}}\bigg\|_{F}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mover><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mover><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>D</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mrow><mo maxsize="2.100em" minsize="2.100em" stretchy="true">‖</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>V</mi></msub></mrow><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>N</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⊗</mo><msubsup><mi>W</mi><mi>V</mi><mi>T</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>X</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>T</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mo>∂</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mo>∂</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⊗</mo><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>K</mi></msub></mrow><msqrt><mi>D</mi></msqrt></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>V</mi></msub></mrow><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>N</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⊗</mo><msubsup><mi>W</mi><mi>V</mi><mi>T</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>X</mi><mi>j</mi><mi>T</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mo>∂</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mo>∂</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⊗</mo><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>K</mi></msub></mrow><msqrt><mi>D</mi></msqrt></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="2.100em" minsize="2.100em" stretchy="true">‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\stackrel{{\scriptstyle(i)}}{{=}}\frac{2}{ND}\bigg\|(S_{i}X_{i}W_{V}-y_{i})(I_{N}\otimes W_{V}^{T}X_{i}^{T})\frac{\partial S_{i}}{\partial A_{i}}\frac{X_{i}\otimes X_{i}W_{K}}{\sqrt{D}}-(S_{j}X_{j}W_{V}-y_{j})(I_{N}\otimes W_{V}^{T}X_{j}^{T})\frac{\partial S_{j}}{\partial A_{j}}\frac{X_{j}\otimes X_{j}W_{K}}{\sqrt{D}}\bigg\|_{F}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex19"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex19.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\stackrel{{\scriptstyle(ii)}}{{=}}\frac{2}{ND}\Big\|(S_{i}X_{i}W_{V}-y_{i})\,(I_{N}\otimes W_{V}^{T}X_{i}^{T})\,\frac{\partial S_{i}}{\partial A_{i}}\,\Big(\frac{X_{i}\otimes X_{i}W_{K}-X_{j}\otimes X_{j}W_{K}}{\sqrt{D}}\Big)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mover><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mover><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>D</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo fence="false">|</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>V</mi></msub></mrow><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>N</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⊗</mo><msubsup><mi>W</mi><mi>V</mi><mi>T</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>X</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>T</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mo>∂</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mo>∂</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">(</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⊗</mo><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>K</mi></msub></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⊗</mo><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>K</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><msqrt><mi>D</mi></msqrt></mfrac></mstyle><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\stackrel{{\scriptstyle(ii)}}{{=}}\frac{2}{ND}\Big\|(S_{i}X_{i}W_{V}-y_{i})\,(I_{N}\otimes W_{V}^{T}X_{i}^{T})\,\frac{\partial S_{i}}{\partial A_{i}}\,\Big(\frac{X_{i}\otimes X_{i}W_{K}-X_{j}\otimes X_{j}W_{K}}{\sqrt{D}}\Big)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
