</mstyle><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\quad+\Bigl[(S_{i}X_{i}W_{V}-y_{i})\,\Bigl((I_{N}\otimes W_{V}^{T}X_{i}^{T})\Bigl(\frac{\partial S_{i}}{\partial A_{i}}-\frac{\partial S_{j}}{\partial A_{j}}\Bigr)+(I_{N}\otimes W_{V}^{T}(X_{i}^{T}-X_{j}^{T}))\,\frac{\partial S_{j}}{\partial A_{j}}\Bigr)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
